# Test that total CPU cost is computed and exposed in query execution request
# when COMPUTE_PROCESSING_COST is enabled
select id, int_col from functional.alltypes where int_col = 1 limit 10;
---- QUERYOPTIONS
COMPUTE_PROCESSING_COST=1
MAX_FRAGMENT_INSTANCES_PER_NODE=4
---- PLAN
Max Per-Host Resource Reservation: Memory=0B Threads=1
Per-Host Resource Estimates: Memory=10MB
Analyzed query: SELECT id, int_col FROM functional.alltypes WHERE int_col =
CAST(1 AS INT) LIMIT CAST(10 AS BIGINT)

