|  Per-Instance Resources: mem-estimate=10.00MB mem-reservation=0B thread-reservation=1
PLAN-ROOT SINK
|  output exprs: id, int_col
|  mem-estimate=4.00MB mem-reservation=4.00MB spill-buffer=2.00MB thread-reservation=0
|
00:SCAN HDFS [functional.alltypes]
   partitions=24/24 files=24 size=478.45KB
   predicates: int_col = CAST(1 AS INT)
   stored statistics:
     table: rows=7.30K size=478.45KB
   extrapolated-rows=disabled max-scan-range-rows=310
   mem-estimate=16.00MB mem-reservation=0B thread-reservation=0
   tuple-ids=0 row-size=8B cardinality=730
   in pipelines: 00(GETNEXT)
